=2 Walkthrough
!Warhorse Hoofprint.png|right|Warhorse Hoofprint
* After accepting the quest, find the **Warhorse Hoofprint** located somewhere in the Aht Urhgan regions.
* Click on the **Warhorse Hoofprint** to receive the {k:Dark Rider hoofprint}.
** The **Warhorse Hoofprint** now shows up on {p:widescan|Widescan} as of the December 2015 update and is found in four different zones:
*** {z:Bhaflau Thickets}
*** {z:Caedarva Mire}
*** {z:Mount Zhayolm}
*** {z:Wajaom Woodlands}
* Return to Naja to complete the quest.

